    "q-83563": {
      "dom_id": "step-q83563",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "Find the orthogonal projection of the vector $x$ onto the plane $r=sv+tw,$ where $s,t\\in R,$ and\n\n$$\nv=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],\\,w=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}],\\,x=[\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 12\\end{aligned}].\n$$",
      "worked_solution": "First, notice that $v$ and $w$ are linearly independent. \n\nThe orthogonal projection of $x$ onto the subspace $S$ spanned by the columns of a matrix $A$ is given by\n\n$$\n{\\text{proj}}_{S}\\,x=A({A}^{T}\\,A)^{-1}\\,{A}^{T}\\,x.\n$$\n\nSince our plane passes through the origin, it defines the subspace $S=\\text{Span}\\{v,w\\}$ in ${R}^{3}.$ In our case, we have\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}| & | \\\\ v & w \\\\ | & |\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & \\text{ }1\\,\\, &  \\\\ 1 & \\text{ }1\\,\\, \\\\ 0 & \\,\\,\\,-1\\,\\,\\,\\,\\end{aligned}]\\,⟹\\,{A}^{T}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, we get the following projection:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{S}\\,x & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & \\text{ }1\\,\\, &  \\\\ 1 & \\text{ }1\\,\\, \\\\ 0 & \\,\\,\\,-1\\,\\,\\,\\,\\end{aligned}]\\cdot {([\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-1 & \\text{ }1\\,\\, &  \\\\ 1 & \\text{ }1\\,\\, \\\\ 0 & \\,\\,\\,-1\\,\\,\\,\\,\\end{aligned}])}^{-1}\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 12\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & \\text{ }1\\,\\, &  \\\\ 1 & \\text{ }1\\,\\, \\\\ 0 & \\,\\,\\,-1\\,\\,\\,\\,\\end{aligned}]\\cdot {[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{aligned}]}^{-1}\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-6 \\\\ -6\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & \\,\\,-1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot \\frac{1}{6}[\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-6 \\\\ -6\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & \\,\\,-1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-83563-a",
